          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#FF5A1F]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"></path></svg>
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#two-machines" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. Two Very Different Machines Share This Name</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. How a Flat Manual Treadmill Works</a>
