          <a href="#where-it-wins" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Where It Genuinely Wins</a>
          <a href="#where-it-fails" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Where It Fails</a>
